## SQ-PJL-01 | pack jam line registered: 10 jam blocks, 10 jello blocks, 10 jellos, 30 cauldrons, 22 fd jam jars, fluids
@group A
@commands Boot, grep the log for `vintagedelight` errors and `Missing model`/`missing texture` with `jam`, `jello`, `cauldron`; registry dump
@pass 10 jam blocks, 10 jello blocks, 10 jellos, 30 cauldrons, 22 `fd_*_jam_jar`, 5 new jars, 19 fluids; no missing model
@fails Vintage `jam/PackJams.java`, `tools/gen_pack_jams.py` (rerun it and `port_resources.py`)
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
shell grep -niE "vintagedelight" logs/latest.log | grep -iE "error|exception|missing|unknown" | head -20 | cut -c1-260; true
> cdevtest reg block ^vintagedelight:[a-z_]+_jam_block$
> cdevtest reg block ^vintagedelight:[a-z_]+_jello_block$
> cdevtest reg item ^vintagedelight:[a-z_]+_jello$
> cdevtest reg block ^vintagedelight:[a-z_]+_cauldron$
> cdevtest reg block fd_[a-z_]+_jam_jar$
> cdevtest reg item _jam_jar$
> cdevtest reg fluid ^vintagedelight: max=200
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=reg kind=fluid regex=\S+ n=\d+ 30
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=reg kind=block regex=\S+_jam_block\S* n=10$
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=reg kind=block regex=\S+_jello_block\S* n=10$
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=reg kind=item regex=\S+_jello\S* n=10$
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=reg kind=block regex=\S+_cauldron\S* n=30$
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=reg kind=block regex=fd_\S+ n=22$
count \[cdevtest\] verb=reg kind=fluid id=vintagedelight:\S+ class= >= 19
look shell output: no vintagedelight error / missing line (models are client-side, not checked here); fluid n = 19 sources (38 with flowing ids); "5 new jars" = the jam jars of the pack line beyond Vintage's own (verb=reg kind=item id= lines for _jam_jar: ancient_fruit, banana, mulberry, strawberry and the rest; note the n)
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0

## SQ-PJL-02 | pack jam jars cooked in the pot; no Upgrade Aquatic mulberry jam recipes; given UA jam items become Vintage's
@group A
@commands Recipe dump; give `upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam_bottle` and `mulberry_jam_block`, relog
@pass `creativedelight:fdcooking/{ancient_fruit,banana,mulberry,strawberry}_jam_jar`; no `upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam_*` or Central Kitchen bottle / mixing ids; given items become `vintagedelight:mulberry_jam_jar` / `mulberry_jam_block`
@fails CD `vintagedelight/jams.js` "Pack jam line"; swaps `merges_upgrade_aquatic_jams.json`
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# self-contained since r1118 (rowfix-1, 2026-11-18): bot spawn from r1113 c2_a1 SQ-C2-00
> forceload add 296 290 360 380
> execute unless entity c2b run pbot spawn c2b 300.5 -60 296.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> cdevtest recipes farmersdelightcooking/ancient_fruit_jam_jar
> cdevtest recipes farmersdelightcooking/banana_jam_jar
> cdevtest recipes farmersdelightcooking/mulberry_jam_jar
> cdevtest recipes farmersdelightcooking/strawberry_jam_jar
> cdevtest recipes upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam
> cdevtest recipes mulberry_jam
> give c2b upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam_bottle 2
> give c2b upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam_block 1
sleep 3
> pbot inv c2b get
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=pbot\.inv bot=c2b filled= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/ancient_fruit_jam_jar result=
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/banana_jam_jar result=
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/mulberry_jam_jar result=
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/strawberry_jam_jar result=
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes text=upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam n=0
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=pbot\.inv bot=c2b slot=\d+ item=vintagedelight:mulberry_jam_jar\*
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=pbot\.inv bot=c2b slot=\d+ item=vintagedelight:mulberry_jam_block\*
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=pbot\.inv bot=c2b slot=\d+ item=upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_jam
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=create_central_kitchen:\S*mulberry_jam
> clear c2b
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=pbot\.\S+ bot=\S+ error=

