## SQ-PJL-05 | nut milk jar recipes and tags; jam / jello tags; soft fluid containers capacity 1
@group A
@commands Recipe dump; tag check; read `data/vintagedelight/moonlight/soft_fluids/*.json` in the jar
@pass `fdcooking/nut_milk_jar`, `nut_milk_jar_from_bottle`, `nut_milk_bottle_from_jar`; nut milk jar in `#forge:milk`; new jars in `#forge:jams`, new jellos in `#fruitsdelight:jello`; every soft fluid container `capacity` 1
@fails `jams.js`, `port_resources.py` `convert_soft_fluid`
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest recipes nut_milk
> cdevtest tagsof vintagedelight:nut_milk_jar
> cdevtest tag item forge:jams
> cdevtest tag item fruitsdelight:jello
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tag kind=item tag=fruitsdelight:jello n= 20
shell python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/c2_famcheck.py softfluids $(ls mods/creativedelight-*.jar | head -1) 2>&1 | cut -c1-300
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/nut_milk_jar result=
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:shapeless/nut_milk_jar_from_bottle result=
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:shapeless/nut_milk_bottle_from_jar result=
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof id=vintagedelight:nut_milk_jar item_tags=\S*forge:milk\b
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tag kind=item tag=forge:jams n=\d+ ids=\S*vintagedelight:ancient_fruit_jam_jar\S*vintagedelight:banana_jam_jar
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tag kind=item tag=forge:jams n=\d+ ids=\S*vintagedelight:mulberry_jam_jar\S*vintagedelight:strawberry_jam_jar
look fruitsdelight:jello ids= holds the new jellos; shell: every soft fluid container line is "capacity 1" (no other capacity line)
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0

